===Etymology===
{{inh+|fr|ML.|Sargia}}, of {{unk|fr|nocap=1}} origin. {{w|Richard Coates}} proposes a {{der|fr|sem|-}} origin, from {{der|fr|sem-pro|*śrq|t=east, rise (of the sun), redden}}. Lepelley suggests a Scandinavian/{{der|fr|gmq|-}} origin, from {{der|fr|non|serkr|t=shirt}}. More at [[w:Sark#Etymology|Sark]].

